---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import fs from 'node:fs';
const imgs = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('data/images.json', 'utf8'));
---
<Page title="Image credits and licenses" eyebrow="Legal" description="Where every image, chart and typeface on FBA Tactics comes from, and the license each is used under." updated="November 8, 2026">
  <h2>Charts, diagrams and page graphics</h2>
  <p>All charts, diagrams, timelines and page header graphics are drawn by this site in code from the sourced figures on each page. They are original work of the publisher. Sharing images (the preview shown when a page is linked) are generated the same way.</p>
  <h2>Photographs</h2>
  {imgs.length === 0
    ? <p>The site currently publishes no photographs. Photographs from the previous version of the site were removed because their license records were incomplete.</p>
    : <table><thead><tr><th>Image</th><th>Creator</th><th>Source</th><th>License</th></tr></thead><tbody>{imgs.map((i: any) => <tr><td>{i.alt}</td><td>{i.author}</td><td><a href={i.source_url} rel="noopener">{i.library}</a></td><td><a href={i.license_url} rel="noopener">{i.license}</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table>}
  <h2>Typefaces</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono — © IBM Corp., SIL Open Font License 1.1.</li>
    <li>Source Serif 4 — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (distributed through the Fontsource project).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Fonts are served from this site; no font service is contacted when you load a page.</p>
  <h2>Trademarks and screenshots</h2>
  <p>The site does not display marketplace logos or screenshots of seller dashboards.</p>
</Page>
